# caption: Validate a proposed semantic lowering through explicit obligations.

REQUIRE source operation contract, target sequence, established input facts
ENSURE accepted lowering only when every required obligation is discharged
check target typing, widths, control edges, and memory dependencies
formulate successful-value and final-memory obligations
formulate required event, exceptional-outcome, and termination obligations
FORALL required obligations DO
  IF the selected proof mechanism cannot establish the obligation THEN
    RETURN unresolved or rejected
  END IF
END FOR
RETURN accepted with recorded assumptions

